      "updated": 1789485794739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "f (int index, int currentCoinSum ) :\n\n\n    if(currentSum>x) return 0;\n\n    if(curretnSum==x) return 1;    \n\n    int ans =  0;    \n    for(int i = index;  i < n ; i++) {\n        if(currentCoinSum+coin[i]<=x){\n            ans += f(i,currentCoinSum+coin[i])\n        }    \n    }\n\n    return ans;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "f (int index, int currentCoinSum ) :\n\n\n    if(currentSum>x) return 0;\n\n    if(curretnSum==x) return 1;    \n\n    int ans =  0;    \n    for(int i = index;  i < n ; i++) {\n        if(currentCoinSum+coin[i]<=x){\n            ans += f(i,currentCoinSum+coin[i])\n        }    \n    }\n\n    return ans;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
