      "updated": 1789490498540,
      "created": 1789490193623,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int **dp\n\nint solve(int index,int event) :\n    \n    if(event == 2*k(4) or index==n)\n        return 0\n\n    if(dp[index][event] != -1 ) :\n        return dp[index][event]\n\n    // skip this day\n\n    ans1 = solve(index+1,event)\n\n    // perfoming the possible events/ transaction\n    transactionType = event%2 ==0 ? \"BUY\" :\"SELL \"\n\n    if transactionType == \"BUY\"\n        ans2 = -prices[index]+solve(index+1,event+1)\n\n    else :\n        ans2 = prices[i]+solve(index+1,event+1)\n    \n    return dp[index][event]= max(ans1,ans2)\n\nmain():\n\n    //input\n    \n    // dp[n][2*k=4] = //all -1\n    ans = solve(0,0)\n    \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int **dp\n\nint solve(int index,int event) :\n    \n    if(event == 2*k(4) or index==n)\n        return 0\n\n    if(dp[index][event] != -1 ) :\n        return dp[index][event]\n\n    // skip this day\n\n    ans1 = solve(index+1,event)\n\n    // perfoming the possible events/ transaction\n    transactionType = event%2 ==0 ? \"BUY\" :\"SELL \"\n\n    if transactionType == \"BUY\"\n        ans2 = -prices[index]+solve(index+1,event+1)\n\n    else :\n        ans2 = prices[i]+solve(index+1,event+1)\n    \n    return dp[index][event]= max(ans1,ans2)\n\nmain():\n\n    //input\n    \n    // dp[n][2*k=4] = //all -1\n    ans = solve(0,0)\n    \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
